                                                "sense_id": "c513daa0-855f-3085-9a66-c30faf0db93e",
                                                "text": "It also has a huge disadvantage: when you're off line^([sic]), you're out of luck. You can't get at your web-based mail, you can't get at your online calendar or contact list or documents, you can't do very much."
                                            },
